OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAdministrators appointed to Glens
OL,4,Aof Antrim Potatoes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement said that "following the
OL,7,Fappointment, the company has ceased to
OL,8,Ftrade". It added that "as a result, and
OL,9,Fwith deep regret, all of the company's
OL,10,Femployees, with the exception of a
OL,11,Fsmall skeleton staff retained to
OL,12,Fsupport the administrators, have been
OL,13,Fmade redundant".
